==Battleground==
*6 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is actually decently relaxed with the right units, since the bulk of enemy pushing power is primarily composed of Miz Devils and Relic Doges. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cats]] are going to do most of the heavy lifting in terms of damage; a steady line of [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cats]] or [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cats]] with Research [[Cat Combo]]s keep the frontline completely locked down. Before triggering the boss, try to kill the last Condemned Peng with either [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] or [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] to hopefully max out your wallet, then you can start going on the offensive. Try to hit the enemy base with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], since that completely evaporates the first Midnite D. if he can manage to get two clean hits. Beyond that point, it's just cycling Slapsticks and Jelly Dumplings until victory finds itself in your arms. If you own [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], he stamps out any semblance of difficulty and turns the enemies into enchiladas.

